{
  "file_id": "3573",
  "text_count": 167,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Guys, I know you're all feeling\ndown after what happened to\nPiccolomon...",
      "_offset": 4710,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "But if all we do is think about\nit, we're not gonna to be able to\nget anything done.",
      "_offset": 4784,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Tai.",
      "_offset": 4869,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Yeah, Tai's right.",
      "_offset": 4877,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "We have to keep going, for\nPiccolomon's sake.",
      "_offset": 4899,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "You're right. This won't be a safe\nplace for long, either.",
      "_offset": 4945,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Yeah, let's go!",
      "_offset": 5004,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Are you tired, Kari?",
      "_offset": 5020,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I'm fine right now.",
      "_offset": 5043,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "You've seen a lot of horrible\nthings happen as soon as we came\nto the Digital World.",
      "_offset": 5063,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "You knew Piccolomon, right?",
      "_offset": 5148,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "So it must be a lot more painful\nfor you than it is for me...",
      "_offset": 5176,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I don't want Piccolomon mad at us.",
      "_offset": 5238,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Yeah, you're right.",
      "_offset": 5273,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Mad?",
      "_offset": 5293,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Piccolomon was always getting mad\nat us...",
      "_offset": 5298,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "He said that even though we were\nthe Chosen Children, we were an\neyesore.",
      "_offset": 5341,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "So he always had high expectations\nfor you.",
      "_offset": 5415,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Right! So we can't let Piccolomon\ndown!",
      "_offset": 5459,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "So let's give it our all together,\nKari!",
      "_offset": 5499,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 5542,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "It really makes me sad, knowing\nthat all the Digimon we knew\naren't here anymore...",
      "_offset": 5548,
      "_length": 83,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "I don't know if we can keep going\nat this rate…",
      "_offset": 5632,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Yeah...",
      "_offset": 5681,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I wonder if I can get any\nstronger...",
      "_offset": 5689,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Seems like Matt's feeling\ndown... what can I do to make him\ncheer up?",
      "_offset": 5727,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "You can make food for him.",
      "_offset": 5799,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "It's best to just take it slowly.",
      "_offset": 5826,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "You're right! If he eats\nsomething, he'll feel better!\nThanks, Joe!",
      "_offset": 5860,
      "_length": 67,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Do your best, T.K!",
      "_offset": 5928,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "But I want Matt to cheer up...",
      "_offset": 5950,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Everyone has times when they want\nto take it slowly.",
      "_offset": 5983,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I guess so...",
      "_offset": 6036,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "I shouldn't rely on Matt all the\ntime...",
      "_offset": 6050,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "How is everyone doing?",
      "_offset": 6093,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Everyone's gotten a little stronger.",
      "_offset": 6116,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Maybe if you give them more time...",
      "_offset": 6153,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "That's good. I'm currently\ndevoting myself to analyzing the\nDark Masters' data.",
      "_offset": 6189,
      "_length": 79,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "We're counting on you! We need a\nway to defeat them.",
      "_offset": 6269,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Really...? Perhaps it's not the\ntime to be analyzing the Dark\nMasters...",
      "_offset": 6322,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Well, we don't really have an easy\nsolution right now.",
      "_offset": 6395,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Such a huge difference in power,\neven though they're also\nUltimates...",
      "_offset": 6450,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Where are we?",
      "_offset": 6521,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "The beach?",
      "_offset": 6535,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "It's the ocean!",
      "_offset": 6546,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "For some reason, I feel like we've\nbeen here before. Ah!",
      "_offset": 6562,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Broken phone boxes...",
      "_offset": 6619,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "This is the shore on File Island,\nwhere we met the Digimon for the\nfirst time...",
      "_offset": 6641,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "We're back at File Island...",
      "_offset": 6722,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "I wonder if this means\nsomething...",
      "_offset": 6751,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Sh-Shellmon!",
      "_offset": 6787,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Do you know him, Tai?",
      "_offset": 6800,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "We fought this Shellmon once!",
      "_offset": 6825,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "This isn't the time to be saying\nyou're tired, guys! We have to\nsave everyone!",
      "_offset": 6855,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 6934,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Let's go!",
      "_offset": 6940,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Llama Bebé!",
      "_offset": 6950,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "MiniFuego!",
      "_offset": 6962,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Magical Fire!",
      "_offset": 6974,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Whew! We got him...",
      "_offset": 6988,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "Thanks, Agumon! You've all gotten\nreally strong.",
      "_offset": 7008,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Why do you think so, Tai?",
      "_offset": 7057,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "When we fought Shellmon before, we\nwere having trouble...",
      "_offset": 7086,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "So we've gotten stronger!",
      "_offset": 7144,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I think so, too.",
      "_offset": 7170,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 7187,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "You've grown really well.",
      "_offset": 7195,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "When you put it like that...",
      "_offset": 7221,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Whaddya think, Izzy?",
      "_offset": 7250,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Well, maybe a bit.",
      "_offset": 7276,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Ah...",
      "_offset": 7295,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Have I grown, too?",
      "_offset": 7301,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "Of course you've grown.",
      "_offset": 7320,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "What about me?",
      "_offset": 7344,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "We've just joined them, so we've\ngot some ways to go.",
      "_offset": 7359,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "How disappointing...",
      "_offset": 7413,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "It's okay, they said everyone's\ngetting stronger!",
      "_offset": 7434,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "What's that...?",
      "_offset": 7484,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Is that... a beach hut?",
      "_offset": 7500,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Why is there a beach hut here?",
      "_offset": 7524,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Maybe they'll have noodles!",
      "_offset": 7555,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Or curry rice!",
      "_offset": 7583,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Let's go check it out!",
      "_offset": 7598,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Wait a minute!",
      "_offset": 7621,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "What's wrong, Joe?",
      "_offset": 7636,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "Well, you know...",
      "_offset": 7655,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Isn't this a little suspicious?",
      "_offset": 7673,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "It's totally a trap! I'm not going!",
      "_offset": 7705,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "What do you mean? We're checking\nit out *because* it's suspicious,\nright?",
      "_offset": 7741,
      "_length": 73,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "While you're talking about all\nthat, we're gonna eat all the food\nthey have!",
      "_offset": 7815,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "I'm starving, too... sorry, Joe.",
      "_offset": 7892,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Aren't you going too?",
      "_offset": 7925,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "I want to, but... I can't just go\nafter I said all that...",
      "_offset": 7947,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "What are you talking about?!",
      "_offset": 8006,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "We have to hurry, or they'll eat\neverything!",
      "_offset": 8035,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Don't worry about it, let's go!",
      "_offset": 8080,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Ah! What's going on?!",
      "_offset": 8112,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "The door isn't opening!",
      "_offset": 8134,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "Hahaha! This isn't just any old\nbeach hut, you know.",
      "_offset": 8158,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "What?! Who...",
      "_offset": 8211,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "This place sucks energy out from\nyou, making it your deathbed!",
      "_offset": 8225,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "I feel like I'm losing power...",
      "_offset": 8288,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Aaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8320,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Gyaaaaaaaaaah!",
      "_offset": 8328,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "I did it, I did it! I collected\nall the Chosen Children!",
      "_offset": 8343,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "So it was all a trap...",
      "_offset": 8400,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "Guys, are you okay?",
      "_offset": 8424,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "I'll take your energy while I'm\nhere!",
      "_offset": 8444,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "We've got no choice but to fight!",
      "_offset": 8482,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "Let's go, Joe!",
      "_offset": 8516,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "Anomalocarimooooooon...",
      "_offset": 8531,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "Looks like we knocked him out!",
      "_offset": 8555,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "All right, let's save everyone\nwhile we have the chance!",
      "_offset": 8586,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "english": "Tai! Guys!",
      "_offset": 8643,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "english": "Y-You saved us, Joe...",
      "_offset": 8657,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "english": "When he started taking away our\nenergy, we were gonna be done\nfor...",
      "_offset": 8680,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "english": "Sorry, Joe, this wouldn't have\nhappened if we'd listened to\nyou...",
      "_offset": 8749,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
